   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "a9cddd8b-24ea-43a4-8791-a48e1eef4169"], Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
    "Method"], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "99e9ce9c-a296-4264-993c-aaeb59a96faa"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "467462c2-116e-4a04-a44a-7910516f1dc3"], Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData["Automatic"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "6cd2e7c7-f373-49e8-9f24-40eddef4e010"],
     " (default), ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Exhaustive\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "2282c3ab-df73-4c44-be2a-7fc5050bc8f1"],
     ", ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<Exhaustive\>\"", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Pruning\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "spec"}]}], "}"}]], 
      "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "bc34a573-3a70-44a0-b170-ad9c6cab277b"],
     ", ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Greedy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "35438389-e425-47a2-afea-03ac07cf0dc1"],
     ", ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<RandomGreedy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "2c4a7677-5b45-4a40-9d16-9fba322d6dc2"]
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"259395e0-a35d-4f06-8d99-706d715f6306"], 
    Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData["Automatic"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "54f770ba-683b-42bc-a8cb-efc3f9a5ddab"],
     " resolves by the count: ",
     Cell[BoxData["All"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "3cef1521-e184-4bc7-ba16-7f942f7f6304"],
     " to ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Exhaustive\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "44ae7997-3ae5-4cef-a583-0dc7d66822b8"],
     ", the pool; a bounded or absent count to ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Greedy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "ec4b2323-263f-4a1b-8ddd-d39e138dc134"],
     ", which takes the admissible pairs and the branches of each DAG in \
candidate order, so the count-less call is deterministic. ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<RandomGreedy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "c540ee10-b9c3-4c9d-8636-643bfa56da92"],
     " takes them in random order, seeded by an ambient ",
     Cell[BoxData["SeedRandom"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "fed5f001-539d-42c1-83e9-d1bc46c34301"],
     ". The class is the same under every value; ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Pruning\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "d83ec8b3-1d84-4b13-97b5-af441291b54b"],
     " is accepted and inert, the pool having no frontier to cap."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"9a191203-2a5e-423e-a63a-564c48a9576d"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "ec6bb79f-175b-423a-99a1-6aafeb77e42b"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<Direction\>\""], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "5ea348c2-1fd0-419c-a962-0151ac47e7e1"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "b7ffdadb-f0ed-456b-86da-6273234e9545"], Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<BothSides\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "561c45fc-5336-46b4-b94c-b296707c2c8b"],
     " (default), ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Forward\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "56d6e27c-6f11-4617-9d96-9e120d5f52f6"],
     ", ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Backward\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "a567dac2-7a11-4e00-8a6c-3a798364ac35"]
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"df17de75-c04d-4931-9517-69c63f9cccbc"], 
    Cell[TextData[{
     "which ends may move: ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Forward\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "e30d512d-0ee3-4f9e-8535-4195a366840b"],
     " keeps ",
     StyleBox["p1", "TI"],
     " and extends past ",
     StyleBox["p2", "TI"],
     " only, ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Backward\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "123e29d5-a83a-4a98-81fd-1a47a2137d19"],
     " the reverse."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"ab644d3d-eafc-4860-9d2e-d29e05080975"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "44fea9de-a87c-43cf-bb37-93a9ae45cd67"], Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
    "Properties"], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "bd32d88c-15ff-4f1c-907a-754cc710273a"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "01716524-8176-4b5c-a9c4-f2b180a873eb"], Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
     RowBox[{"{", "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "5980f0a9-78cd-482b-8728-4022b748292d"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "d5ceaa95-c7a2-4b1e-8b2b-f0da86f85520"], Cell[TextData[{
     "only the empty list; a rule on the extension is a local law and lives \
on ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      TemplateBox[{
        Cell[
         TextData["ExtendInfraGeodesic"]], 
        "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/ExtendInfraGeodesic", 
